    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "hey, i'm writing a paper for my art history class about deconstruction in modern art. i've noticed a huge trend lately where artists seem to care way more about pushing a political message than actually making something aesthetically beautiful. how do you think this shift toward prioritizing politics over beauty has impacted the overall value of contemporary art?",
